<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Litecom — third-party notices</title>
  <style>
    body { max-width: 900px; margin: auto; padding: 32px 20px; font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, sans-serif; color: #17202c; }
    a { color: #233a9c; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    h1, h2 { line-height: 1.2; }
    section { border-top: 1px solid #ddd; padding-top: 20px; margin-top: 32px; }
    pre { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; font-size: 13px; padding: 16px; background: #f5f6f8; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Third-party notices</h1>
  <p>Litecom uses the Cargo dependencies below. This file includes dependencies
  for all configured release platforms; an individual binary may use a subset.</p>
  <p>Each component's source link downloads the exact, unmodified crate release.
  The listed licenses apply to those components. Litecom's own source is licensed
  under Apache-2.0. External coding agents and separately installed adapters have
  their own distributions and licenses.</p>
  <p>Generated from Cargo.lock with cargo-about. To regenerate, see CONTRIBUTING.md.</p>
  <ul>
  {{#each overview}}
    <li>{{name}} — {{count}} components</li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  {{#each licenses}}
  <section id="license-{{@index}}">
    <h2>{{name}}</h2>
    <ul>
    {{#each used_by}}
      <li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}} —
        <a href="https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/{{crate.name}}/{{crate.version}}/download">source</a>
      </li>
    {{/each}}
    </ul>
    <pre>{{text}}</pre>
  </section>
  {{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
